{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "069c5e740c7d80d044915c1a71e35143b5996186f1fbeaac413fa2f701c56f6a", "ja": "えっ、みんなもう覚えちゃったの？\nすごい……！", "zh": "诶，大家已经全都记住了吗？\n好厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
