{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "8b30d20cec3ff9fc36d468657c9f8ef354d4a5e3dd8ed57cd599cbf71634b20f", "ja": "そんなこと……ないと思うけど……。", "zh": "应该……没那回事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "091429a5c98e66d1915a2151609f00f63664da6d9e140576399731c1f80ade00", "ja": "あ……。亜利沙ちゃん！\nさっきの動画って、アイドルフェスの時のだよね？", "zh": "啊……亚利沙！\n刚才那个视频，是偶像庆典时拍的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "60859d4266e22772974246ed1dd5d3a676bf691d135264cd0d2c3bfa4a567f3f", "ja": "え？　はい、前に雪歩ちゃんが出た、\nアイドルフェスのステージで……。", "zh": "咦？是的，是之前雪步参加的偶像节现场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "b8a41e29b22e8a3e2e3deadf3a1ad805ab27dfd52c4de71d574bea109e6093d4", "ja": "はああっ！　そうです、ステージです！　ありさ、\nよけいなコトしちゃいました！　ごめんなさい～～！", "zh": "哈啊啊！对，就是舞台！亚利沙做了多余的事！对不起～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1030_p", "source_sha256": "9808cdb313b37830bc97de156157575b0b64ff20d87dae80e782531cb8dedbe7", "ja": "そうだった……。アイドルフェスのステージは、\n劇場より大きかったもんな。", "zh": "对了……偶像祭典的舞台，比剧场大来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1031_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2bb97acf199ba6ec81af28ac87a482f7f879cdcd46ca4d6edb5ed55c28ea470a", "ja": "はい……。その分、みんな大きく動いてたから、\n今の立ち位置だと、詰まっちゃって……。", "zh": "是的……因为舞台比剧场大，大家的动作幅度也更大。\n按照现在的站位，就会挤在一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
