{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1042_038chz", "source_sha256": "94ffbcd13cf1b534c57bdaacc6ffb3a127b3c3ce6a2ab38e005b740728a27d76", "ja": "そうですわ、これは雪歩ちゃんの公演ですもの。\n遠慮は禁物ですわよ？", "zh": "没错，这是雪步的演出嘛。\n可千万别客气哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
