{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1045_020meg", "source_sha256": "6a0e1055b344cae34233da0a93169370ea23ec3e4039a78a57932862854d164d", "ja": "え？　変えてって……\n好きにアレンジしちゃえってこと？", "zh": "诶？让我们改……是说可以随心所欲地编排吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1046_049mom", "source_sha256": "d93d67fc929093a0cb0ead5a5798411e6a5f2df1a9fd4c165be324ac368424c0", "ja": "で、でも、それって……\n覚えるだけより難しくない……？", "zh": "可、可是，那样不是……\n比起只记住内容，不是更难吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1047_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fdfcde12871d3eeeaf0b3411830ce67fa3bb91f711456b1694419ad1aea29a53", "ja": "う、うん、そうだよね。\nそうなんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，也是啊。\n虽然是那样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_1048_028ari", "source_sha256": "27feb9eb1448a8fdcdb4817a06613f1bbf58f7b14862f4f6dc59c4411f1b8cc4", "ja": "そ、それに……それだと、今までの雪歩ちゃんの\nステージとは違うモノになっちゃいますよ？", "zh": "而、而且……那样的话，就会变成和以往雪步的舞台不一样的东西了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
