{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_2001_028ari", "source_sha256": "c3977fd05af2386d0da0587a9fe533fe3380ab2396d509b2801498b5ce872e23", "ja": "ひっ！　そ、そうだったんですか！？\nありさ、いつの間にそんなできる子に……！？", "zh": "呀！原、原来是这样吗！？\n亚利沙什么时候变成这么能干的孩子了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_2002_038chz", "source_sha256": "87823a7f38b2b814d43518fa20c383c55c13fb7baa0f491715568538f88f3d64", "ja": "でも、わたくし達がどうにかできたとしても、\n雪歩ちゃんは忙しいのに……本当に平気ですの？", "zh": "不过，就算我们能想办法解决，雪步可是很忙的……真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_2003_020meg", "source_sha256": "f038689efd29bbed3310907b28890a23f403267712f2f5d445bd153a1adf44a8", "ja": "そうだよね？　アタシ達が勝手に動いたら、\n今度は雪歩が合わせらんないでしょ？", "zh": "就是这样吧？要是我们擅自行动，下次雪步就配合不了了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
