{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "50676f90e858fada0f46711b2d2a00e75272edaf8d011c5282a864c034f8fb7d", "ja": "あの、私……ダメダメですけど、\nできる……だけ……。", "zh": "那个，我……虽然很没用，但我会……尽我……所能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4a259a7a92b2b64b44c08c5a0a63d8ecbf1dea4ec3cfd1ad79aeb8f7ca8c9ffc", "ja": "ううん。……できます。せっかくの劇場公演なのに、\nダメダメだなんて……言っちゃダメですよね？", "zh": "不。……我能做到。难得有剧场公演，\n可不能……说什么不行之类丧气的话，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b41fb231d60dbe9b47210bedca68dce7abced69e1340668741631ca00ee186b6", "ja": "だから、やってみせますっ。たとえレッスンが\nほんのちょっぴりでも、どんとこいですぅ！", "zh": "所以，我会努力做到的！就算练习时间只有一点点，也尽管放马过来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3010_p", "source_sha256": "e0bc50a9cdb833526c677772809e7ce3cdf9f3ee9d7aadb048f8208cc2bc2522", "ja": "……そうこなくっちゃな！\nというわけで、みんな。俺からも頼めないか？", "zh": "……这就对了嘛！\n所以说，各位。我也能拜托大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3011_020meg", "source_sha256": "87bcf4fdd90a48afc5e548f72d7deda20412a053fb743b1edd419f21e1d78c1f", "ja": "……も～。そんなの聞くまでもないって！\nね、みんな！　いっちょがんばろっか♪", "zh": "……真是的～这还用问嘛！\n对吧，大家！加把劲好好干一场吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3012_038chz", "source_sha256": "c50a59072ea7696dadf63ca549631fe9f234ec373d426f5d5f395f2e67a1511c", "ja": "ええ、お任せくださいまし！\nセレブに不可能はありませんわ！", "zh": "当然，包在我身上！\n对名媛来说，没有什么是不可能的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3013_028ari", "source_sha256": "36940edff8ab6674512a393e5f8c3ef39a7868c5e527368e2c7445b922b86bd8", "ja": "ありさも……できるって、言ってもらっちゃいました。\nだから、どんとこいです！", "zh": "亚利沙也……被夸奖说能做到了。\n所以，尽管放马过来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3014_049mom", "source_sha256": "e1a70d0acd2d7fab1c6147b9e970d36b85ea2f7398d5cb1bbe28664a1b5d6be9", "ja": "桃子もプロだから平気だよ。さっきはちょっと\n失敗しちゃったけど、もうコツはつかんだもん。", "zh": "桃子也是专业的，所以没关系。刚才虽然稍微失败了一下，但我已经掌握诀窍了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3015_020meg", "source_sha256": "9a829f580d83865c3d2e9c9d4fb11d67bd19b8d547ad2a603fd239f69fd072cf", "ja": "え、そうなの桃子？　すごいじゃん！\nねえねえ、そのコツっていうの教えてよ～。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗，桃子？好厉害啊！\n呐呐，快告诉我你说的诀窍嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3016_p", "source_sha256": "6997119aeba83a63c2c13ad17a0d804fe3a036b97a1fe8187b0f19ccc53030f9", "ja": "……あ、そうか。桃子の歩幅だと、もともと\n小さめのステージに向いてるんだよな。", "zh": "……啊，也是。以桃子的步幅，本来就\n更适合偏小的舞台吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3017_049mom", "source_sha256": "ac07da54ae19012885b8abbffb0844fc60c2a7c3b3eeaa2dc1cd7fde5d928759", "ja": "……お兄ちゃんは余計なこと言わないで！\nあっち行ってて！", "zh": "……大哥哥不要多嘴！\n去那边待着啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "77e8e0b056ee0a2b6ccdea5e6f1f523c5a3e8e27bf0c3bb97fb244615d3f960e", "ja": "恵美ちゃん、千鶴さん、亜利沙ちゃん、桃子ちゃん……\nみんな、ありがとう……！", "zh": "惠美、千鹤小姐、亚利沙、桃子……\n大家，谢谢你们……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "64af50e9b67b0bf9b3c5dd5ec17cfa7c0f2a6ef73cd7003cecfe5dc38cc1dca0", "ja": "それじゃ……今からもう一回、\n合わせてみてもいいかな？", "zh": "那么……现在再合练一次，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c70686a5c777b31c46c3662874072d3eef049709a9aa7e3a84d6127d0a41d892", "ja": "あんまり、今までのやり方は気にしないで……\nみんなが最高って思う感じで！", "zh": "不用太在意至今为止的做法……\n只要大家觉得怎样最好，就照那样的感觉来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3021_020meg", "source_sha256": "b515a02f6733dc5fc853d320c03d85a4f9d4138ad05bdc9361224e685b087948", "ja": "オッケー！　振り付けも立ち位置も、\n基本はもう覚えてるから大丈夫♪", "zh": "好嘞！编舞和站位基本都已经记住了，没问题♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3022_038chz", "source_sha256": "8e3f215d4b2d723be6bcb9910c8cdeb38918abc778db7426dbae3af0f46a4c84", "ja": "ええ！　あとはわたくし達らしく、ゴージャスに\n振る舞うだけですわ！　おーっほっほっほっほ！", "zh": "没错！接下来只要展现出属于我们的华丽风采就行了！哦——呵呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3023_049mom", "source_sha256": "9c63555b65963e69fcfdc0aee143506e1d4dde76e5288770ecf95d154b212889", "ja": "雪歩さんは、自分のことに集中してね。\n桃子たちのことは心配しないで。", "zh": "雪步姐，你专心做好自己的事。桃子这边不用担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3024_028ari", "source_sha256": "6b9427aa15e6b93877693d1aba02f960f786173c51516ebfa6682821f14be4cd", "ja": "雪歩ちゃんを、ちゃんとサポートするためです。\nありさも自分を信じて、がんばりますねっ！", "zh": "为了好好支持雪步。 \n亚利沙也会相信自己，加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1a9887a173ceede5e22df910b9bfc11df398d66af68e97f18a5d0acf2e1366e9", "ja": "うんっ、よろしくお願いしますぅ！\n一緒に……素敵な公演にしようね！", "zh": "嗯，请多关照！\n我们一起……把公演办得精彩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3026_p", "source_sha256": "d8ed1442e3d77aba1a46bed5422c62883f4fb6ffea651e666e662ecba219ede0", "ja": "（皆、スタートラインはそれぞれに違っていたが、\n目標は同じ。ステージを成功させること）", "zh": "（大家的起点各不相同，但目标却是一致的——让舞台演出取得成功。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_055_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_055_3027_p", "source_sha256": "8fc525e91ce8fac1f5c0841ef8feb3e82d992b4a592589fcd544db413cea1022", "ja": "（なら、俺も皆を信じよう。\nあとは無事に、公演当日を迎えるだけだ！）", "zh": "（那么，我也相信大家吧。接下来只要平安迎来公演当天就行了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
